How we use it
-------------
- The artifact *design system* (color palette, typography, layout conventions,
  and the "single self-contained HTML document" approach) is distilled from
  Thariq's prompt and examples. Our implementation
  (obsidian-plugin/src/artifacts/designSystem.ts and the claude-plugin
  note-to-artifact skill) is an original reformulation — it expresses the same
  aesthetic in our own prompt/code, and is NOT a copy of the original HTML files.
- Thariq's original HTML set is treated as an upstream reference. Project-
  specific additions belong in `design-system/extensions/` as additive layers,
  so the original set is never modified in place and remains clearly his work.

If you are Thariq and would like attribution changed or removed, please open an
issue on the repository.
